#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst:2
msgid "pca"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:1
msgid "Compute Principal Component Analysis (PCA) on the given input ``x``."
msgstr "与えられた入力 ``x`` に対して主成分分析（PCA）を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:3
msgid ""
"This function computes the covariance matrix of the input observations "
"along the section dimension and then extracts its principal components "
"via singular value decomposition.  The components are returned in "
"descending order of explained variance.  Specifically, ``components[*, i,"
" :]`` represents the :math:`(i+1)`-th largest principal component of the "
"batch specified by ``*``."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、セクション次元に沿って入力観測値の共分散行列を計算し、特異値分解によって主成分を抽出します。主成分は説明分散の降順で返されます。具体的には、``components[*,"
" i, :]`` は ``*`` で指定されたバッチの :math:`(i+1)` 番目に大きい主成分を表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:10
msgid ""
"In qfeval, dimensions and sections often represent symbols and timestamps"
" respectively."
msgstr "qfeval では、次元とセクションはそれぞれ銘柄（シンボル）とタイムスタンプを表すことがよくあります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:14
msgid "The input tensor containing observations."
msgstr "観測値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:17
msgid ""
"A dataclass containing:      - ``components`` (Tensor): Principal "
"components (eigenvectors of       the covariance matrix) of shape "
":math:`(*, D, D)`.       ``components[..., i, j]`` represents the "
":math:`i`-th       component's weight for the :math:`j`-th dimension."
"     - ``explained_variance`` (Tensor): The variance explained by each"
"       component (eigenvalues of the covariance matrix) of shape       "
":math:`(*, D)`, in descending order."
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:19
msgid "A dataclass containing:"
msgstr "以下の要素を含むデータクラス:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:21
msgid ""
"``components`` (Tensor): Principal components (eigenvectors of the "
"covariance matrix) of shape :math:`(*, D, D)`. ``components[..., i, j]`` "
"represents the :math:`i`-th component's weight for the :math:`j`-th "
"dimension."
msgstr ""
"``components`` (Tensor): 形状 :math:`(*, D, D)` "
"の主成分（共分散行列の固有ベクトル）。``components[..., i, j]`` は第 :math:`i` 成分の第 :math:`j` "
"次元に対する重みを表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:25
msgid ""
"``explained_variance`` (Tensor): The variance explained by each component"
" (eigenvalues of the covariance matrix) of shape :math:`(*, D)`, in "
"descending order."
msgstr ""
"``explained_variance`` (Tensor): 形状 :math:`(*, D)` "
"の、各成分によって説明される分散（共分散行列の固有値）。降順に並びます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.pca.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:30
msgid "Shape:"
msgstr "形状:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:31
msgid ""
"x: :math:`(*, S, D)` where ``*`` means any number of additional "
"dimensions, ``S`` means the number of sections, and ``D`` means the "
"number of dimensions."
msgstr ""
"x: :math:`(*, S, D)` ここで、``*`` は任意の追加次元数を、``S`` はセクション数を、``D`` "
"は次元数をそれぞれ表します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:36
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:38
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([[2.0, 0.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, 1.0],\n"
"...                   [-2.0, 0.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, -1.0]])\n"
">>> result = QF.pca(x)\n"
">>> result.components\n"
"tensor([[1., 0.],\n"
"        [0., 1.]])\n"
">>> result.explained_variance\n"
"tensor([2.6667, 0.6667])"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([[2.0, 0.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, 1.0],\n"
"...                   [-2.0, 0.0],\n"
"...                   [0.0, -1.0]])\n"
">>> result = QF.pca(x)\n"
">>> result.components\n"
"tensor([[1., 0.],\n"
"        [0., 1.]])\n"
">>> result.explained_variance\n"
"tensor([2.6667, 0.6667])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:49
msgid ""
"The sign of each principal component is arbitrary: components are defined"
" only up to sign, so an equivalent input may yield components multiplied "
"by -1."
msgstr "各主成分の符号は任意です。主成分は符号を除いてのみ定義されるため、等価な入力に対して -1 倍された主成分が返されることがあります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:54
msgid ""
":func:`pca_cov`: PCA on a precomputed covariance matrix, used in the "
"implementation."
msgstr ":func:`pca_cov`: 実装に使用されている、計算済みの共分散行列に対する PCA。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:56
msgid ":func:`nanpca`: NaN-aware principal component analysis."
msgstr ":func:`nanpca`: NaN を考慮した主成分分析。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.pca.pca:57
msgid ":func:`covar`: Covariance function used in the implementation."
msgstr ":func:`covar`: 実装に使用されている共分散関数。"

